    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII guard for connection lifecycle management. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Ensures <ref refid="classthemis_1_1network_1_1_raft_load_balancer_1ad061005c475d0e969b30e8e74dfb14fc" kindref="member">onConnectionOpened()</ref> and <ref refid="classthemis_1_1network_1_1_raft_load_balancer_1abf185c6015a4fa7cddd287d55abee162" kindref="member">onConnectionClosed()</ref> are called in pairs, even if errors occur or exceptions are thrown. Prevents connection leaks from imbalanced callback invocations.</para>
<para>Example: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>conn<sp/>=<sp/>lb-&gt;selectBackend();<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Get<sp/>backend<sp/>address</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">lb-&gt;onConnectionOpened(conn);<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Manual<sp/>open<sp/>(or<sp/>use<sp/>guard)</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>...<sp/>use<sp/>connection<sp/>...</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">lb-&gt;onConnectionClosed(conn);<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Manual<sp/>close</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>OR<sp/>using<sp/>guard<sp/>(exception-safe):</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1network_1_1_raft_load_balancer_1_1_connection_guard_1aa3d3ba01172324d4d4a9a2787296720c" kindref="member">ConnectionGuard</ref><sp/>guard(*lb,<sp/>backend_address);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>...<sp/>use<sp/>connection<sp/>(guard.address()<sp/>==<sp/>backend_address)</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>guard<sp/>destructor<sp/>calls<sp/>onConnectionClosed<sp/>even<sp/>if<sp/>exception</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
